User must provide NAM meteorological data in a directory tree
   data/ungrib
and GOCART data in 
   data/gocart
Both must exist in the run directory.

See ungrib.reg script to see how NAM data would be used.
See namelist.gocart2wrf to see about GOCART data use.

Data and files for this tutorial can be obtained from:

/discover/nobackup/projects/nu-wrf/tutorial/chemistry_workflow
